  <constraints>
    <constraint source="project">ADR number is **ADR-045** — NOT ADR-033 (taken). Re-verify 045 is free before writing; if claimed in the interim, use the next free number and update all task references + this task's notes.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project (§3 write boundary)">MAIN-SESSION ONLY. Sub-agents cannot write to `.claude/`. This task MUST be executed from the main session, not delegated to an Agent-tool sub-agent.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Author BOTH forms: concise (`.claude/adr/`, MUST/MUST NOT, ~120–160 lines) AND full (`docs/adr/`, rationale + alternatives + consequences).</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-024">ADR-045 explicitly defers the regarding-family mechanism to ADR-024 (extend, never replace) — the engine keeps writing ADR-024 typed lookups.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-028">ADR-045 mandates central `TokenCredential` + `IGraphClientFactory`; MUST NOT `new` a credential/`ConfidentialClientApplication`.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-018">Auto-file is gated behind the per-tenant ADR-018 kill-switch; ADR-045 records the auto-file-ON-for-deterministic-≥0.85 owner decision (ADR Tension Path A) + AI-rungs-never-auto-file rule.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project (NFR-04)">ADR-045 requires channel seams (`ICommunicationChannelSender`/`ICommunicationArchiver`) that new channels extend WITHOUT changing the engine/enrichment/regarding/review layers.</constraint>
  </constraints>

